# Form Builder

A powerful form builder that automatically generates forms from a JSON-like field configuration, integrated with `useForm` and Standard Schema (Valibot, Zod, etc.) for validation.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/form-builder.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/form-builder.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/form-builder.json
```
::

